[I] Lossy audio codec for Bluetooth connections

[T] ldacBT provides a CMake build of the AOSP libldac library, the encoder
[T] for Sony's LDAC lossy audio codec for high-resolution Bluetooth audio.
[T] It is used by PulseAudio and PipeWire Bluetooth modules to stream LDAC
[T] to headphones.

[U] https://github.com/EHfive/ldacBT

[A] Libldac Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

